                <p class="card-link-copy">Upload your daily vehicle or trailer inspection and Quickler builds it into a WhatsApp workflow. Drivers run it before they move; defects are logged against the unit with a photo, ready for the next inspection cycle.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <span class="card-link-kicker">Equipment and plant</span>
                <h3 class="card-link-title">Pre-use condition checks</h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">Lifts, slings, ladders, generators and powered tools all have a pre-use check worth recording. Operators flag a fault by voice note or photo, and it carries forward so the same item is followed up next time.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="card-link">
                <span class="card-link-kicker">Site safety</span>
                <h3 class="card-link-title">Arrival and toolbox walks</h3>
                <p class="card-link-copy">A site safety walkround, hazard board or toolbox check runs the same way. The foreman answers in the chat, hazards are logged with location and photo, and the record is on the dashboard before the walk is finished.</p>
